{"verses":[{"index":1,"text":"Sema: Enyi makafiri"},{"index":2,"text":"Siabudu mnacho kiabudu"},{"index":3,"text":"Wala nyinyi hamuabudu ninaye muabudu"},{"index":4,"text":"Wala sitaabudu mnacho abudu"},{"index":5,"text":"Wala nyinyi hamuabudu ninaye muabudu"},{"index":6,"text":"Nyinyi mna dini yenu, nami nina Dini yangu"}]}